---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Logbook">
  <main>
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>Logbook</h1>
      <p class="tagline">One observation at a time.</p>
    </header>

    <article class="log-entry">
      <time datetime="2026-07-20">20 July 2026</time>

      <h2>Today, the logbook came online.</h2>

      <p>
        Today, the logbook came online.
      </p>

      <p>
        It began as a small idea during the summer: to create a place for
        observations rather than a stream of updates.
      </p>

      <p>
        A place without algorithms, notifications or expectations.
      </p>

      <p>
        Just a quiet corner of the internet. My corner of the internet. 
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>